  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Jharia Coal Mine Methane Project Feasibility Study, through Advanced Resources International, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant funds a feasibility study for Prabha Energy Private Limited (PEPL), a private Indian energy developer, to develop a coal mine methane (CMM) recovery project associated with metallurgic coal mining in the Jharia coalfield in eastern India. The feasibility study will help PEPL determine CMM availability in the coal block, design the drainage system, identify use cases for the captured gas, and assess potential financing sources and cost estimates.</narrative>
  </description>
